.TH sway-things-hook-autostart 1 "" "Sway Things 0.3.0" "Sway Things Manual"
.SH NAME
sway\-things\-hook\-autostart \- Hand the session\*(Aqs variables to the systemd user session and start the XDG autostart entries through it (xdg\-desktop\-autostart.target): run at login while Sway Things starts them with systemd
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsway\-things hook autostart\fR [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Hand the session\*(Aqs variables to the systemd user session and start the XDG autostart entries through it (xdg\-desktop\-autostart.target): run at login while Sway Things starts them with systemd
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Controls when to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
